      "message": "[warning] Line 1141: 🟡 `externalHostAudioActive_` is only reset inside `detachHost()` when state is `ACTIVE_ATTACHED`. If `detachHost()` is reached after a state transition, the flag can remain stale-true while host audio is actually gone. Since `Manager::addSubCall()` now gates behavior on `hasExternalHostAudio()`, this can misroute participant-attach behavior. Make the flag reset unconditional during host detach (or derive it from the same synchronized source of truth used for host-audio bindings).",
