      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 906: 🔴 `conferenceSourceRequired_` is set to `true` in `prepareConference()` but never cleared when leaving conference mode (`exitConferenceLocked()` / `stop()`). After a participant exits conference, a later sender restart hits `startSender()`’s guard and fails with \"Conference video source is no longer available\" instead of allowing normal pipeline setup. This creates a deterministic failure path for reused sessions. Clear `conferenceSourceRequired_` when conference ownership is released (or explicitly scope it to active prepared-conference lifetime).",
      "revId": "d2e744204144bc740196c39a2ec5b48df8979988",
